   "width": 300,
   "height": 420,
   "text": "## Read in order\n1. [[Homelab server]]\n2. [[Homelab deployment]]\n3. [[Homelab gateway and sign-in]]\n4. [[Homelab data]]\n5. [[Homelab observability]]\n6. [[Homelab LLM and agent]]\n7. [[Homelab security model]]\n8. [[Homelab failure modes]]\n9. [[Homelab change cookbook]]\n\n[[Decisions]] \u00b7 [[Homelab from zero to senior]]",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
